ncy on structures and ruins that predate known human civilizations. Finally, the three dig into <b>Cursed Necropolis: DC</b>, the first setting book for Mummy: the Cursed.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Congratulations to the three winners of the most recent Darker Days contest. We'll be having the Classic World of Darkness themed segment in the future.</span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T12:11:43-07:00","id":256189,"title":"","content":"Darker Days Presents Gossip Ghouls #1<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-darkling-gossip-ghouls-1/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/ep-logo/pbblog286887/DDlogoversion3copy_1200x628.jpg?s=9499c7891da27e0a17a99385a3bd120b&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-darkling-gossip-ghouls-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> Darker Days Radio Presents Gossip Ghouls #1 | Darker Days Radio </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-darkling-gossip-ghouls-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-darkling-gossip-ghouls-1/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Sam and Michelle head up a brand new Darker Days Darkling series, looking at horror in all forms and media, gaming, and gaming as women. Chris joins them to ask questions and to hit record.This episode looks at what made us weird, favourite horror films, and how we feel horror movies have evolved.Expect bad language, content of an adult nature, and irreverent humour.Be sure to check us out at&nbsp;http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio&nbsp;or our Google Plus Community at&nbsp;https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes! </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">Sam and Michelle head up a brand new Darker Days Darkling series, looking at horror in all forms and media, gaming, and gaming as women. Chris joins them to ask questions and to hit record.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">This episode looks at what made us weird, favourite horror films, and how we feel horror movies have evolved.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">Expect bad language, content of an adult nature, and irreverent humour.<br /> <br /> <br /> Darker Days Radio Episode #59<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-59/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/image-logo/286887/darkerdays_sq_1200x628.jpg?s=ef9d996b77a32657cc00ba35c6884454&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-59/\" target=\"_blank\"> #59: Skeletons in the Closet | Darker Days Radio </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-59/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-59/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Season 6 begins where the epic Season 5 cliffhanger left off. Mike hangs from a chasm cliff with only his finger tips. Chris faces off against the 8th deathlord, Nagash. And Chigg stands in the underworld halls alone, his plasma pack blinking on empty.On this episode, the hosts reunite from their dangerous situations to discuss cool new World of Darkness books announced at GenCon. After that, Mike presents his skeleton from the closet, The Tremere Chronicle for Vampire: the Masquerade. The trio then delves into a secret frequency covering lost Russian cosmonauts. Finally, Chris presents his own skeleton, Momento Mori for Geist: the Sin-Eaters. &nbsp; Be sure to check us out at&nbsp;http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio&nbsp;or our Google Plus Community at&nbsp;https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes!&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Links for this episode: &nbsp; Midnight Express:&nbsp;http://midnightexpress.podbean.com/ Dave Brookshaw on Fallen World Chronicle:&nbsp;http://theonyxpath.com/addicted-to-mysteries/ Onyx Path 2015 Brochure:&nbsp;http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/133632/Onyx-Path-20142015-Publishing-Brochure </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Skeletons in the Closet</b><br /> <br /> Season 6 begins where the epic Season 5 cliffhanger left off. Mike hangs from a chasm cliff with only his finger tips. Chris faces off against the 8th deathlord, Nagash. And Chigg stands in the underworld halls alone, his plasma pack blinking on empty.<br /> <br /> On this episode, the hosts reunite from their dangerous situations to discuss cool new World of Darkness books announced at GenCon. After that, Mike presents his skeleton from the closet, The Tremere Chronicle for <b>Vampire: the Masquerade</b>. The trio then delves into a secret frequency covering lost Russian cosmonauts. Finally, Chris presents his own skeleton, Momento Mori for <b>Geist: the Sin-Eaters</b>.<br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T06:21:37-08:00","id":400220,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-62/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Darker Days Radio Episode #62</b></a><br /> <br /> <b>Mage Across Russia</b></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mike, Chris, and Chigg are joined by Darker Days Radio Werewolf Correspondent, Matt!</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mike and Matt tackle the early Werewolf sourcebook <b>Rage Across Russia</b>, redeeming the problematic book with some enigmatic assistance from Chigg. Following that, Mike presents a secret frequency on the slavic holy text, The Book of Veles. For the New World of Darkness, Chris discusses what we've learned so far about <b>Mage: the Awakening 2nd Edition</b>. Finally, the crew answers 