adio-episode-69/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> &nbsp; Mike, Chris, and Chigg are joined by the luminaries of By Night Studios. CEO Jason the Elder, Lead Editor Jennifer \"Loopy,\" and Developer Jason the Younger walk listeners through the basics of Mind's Eye Theater live action role-play and highlight the differences between older editions and their new books. The guests dig deep into Mind's Eye Theater Vampire and Werewolf, presenting epic events from past LARPs and discussing their newest plans. In particular, By Night Studios is excited to present some of their plans for the upcoming Grand Masquerade 2016, September 1st-3rd in New Orleans! Check us out at&nbsp;http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio&nbsp;or our Google Plus Community at&nbsp;https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes!&nbsp; &nbsp; Links for this episode: &nbsp; Contact By Night Studios:&nbsp;http://www.bynightstudios.com/about-us/ Contact White Wolf Publishing:&nbsp;http://www.whitewolf-publishing.com/ The Bitten Clarification:&nbsp;https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/bynightstudios/minds-eye-theatre-werewolf-the-apocalypse/posts/1502415 &nbsp; Chris, David and Sam head up a new, NWoD centric podcast:&nbsp;http://networkzero.podbean.com/ Midnight Express:&nbsp;http://midnightexpress.podbean.com/ Shadowsworn Radio Hour:&nbsp;https://soundcloud.com/theshadowswornradiohour Mike's History Podcast:&nbsp;http://roxlabs.net/unbuttoned/episodes/ </div> </div> </div><br /> Darker Days By Night<br /> <br /> Mike, Chris, and Chigg are joined by the luminaries of By Night Studios. CEO Jason the Elder, Lead Editor Jennifer &quot;Loopy,&quot; and Developer Jason the Younger walk listeners through the basics of Mind's Eye Theater live action role-play and highlight the differences between older editions and their new books. The guests dig deep into Mind's Eye Theater Vampire and Werewolf, presenting epic events from past LARPs and discussing their newest plans. In particular, By Night Studios is excited to present some of their plans for the upcoming Grand Masquerade 2016, September 1st-3rd in New Orleans!<br /> <br /> Check us out at <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.facebook.com/DarkerDaysRadio</a> or our Google Plus Community at <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/communities/104221086985174488220\" target=\"_blank\">https://plus.google.com/communities/...86985174488220</a>. Be sure to subscribe through iTunes! <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-03T06:28:03-07:00","id":858302,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-70/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio #70</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>End of Days, Darker Lines</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chris, and Matt are joined by Tia, artist and Nordic LARPer, who recently participated in the first of the new White Wolf Nordic LARPs, &quot;End of Line&quot;. She takes the time to give us some insight into Nordic LARP, and an overview of her experience in the End of Line event. <br 