"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T12:23:48-08:00","id":1015332,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"http://static.wixstatic.com/media/974095_f71377465b084b8f9be1a13d53ac3059~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_700,h_2000,al_c,q_85/image.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Official Podcast Partner: Darker Days</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>World of Darkness Berlin</b>: We\u2019re happy to share that we\u2019ve joined forces with the awesome podcasters of Darker Days Radio, the Official Podcast Partner of the WoD Berlin convention! Darker Days will tape a live show in Berlin with exciting guests and report on the larps and other events.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">If you for some reason haven\u2019t come across the Darker Days podcast, <a href=\"http://worldofdarkness.berlin/so/9LZfEN9S/click?w=LS0tDQo1MWRjODM3MS02NjA4LTRmNDEtNjM1OC1iMjY2MTBmNTRhODYNCmh0dHA6Ly9wb2RjYXN0LmRhcmtlci1kYXlzLm9yZy8NCi0tLQ\" target=\"_blank\">check it out immediately</a>! It\u2019s friendly, smart and really knowledgeable about <b>White Wolf</b>\u2019s storyworld \u2013 just like all of you. You will love it!</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The World of Darkness Berlin crew will soon be on Darker Days to talk about what the convention is, our vision for the lamps and much more! To ask us questions for that show, please email Darker Days at <a href=\"http://worldofdarkness.berlin/so/9LZfEN9S/click?w=LS0tDQo1MWRjODM3MS02NjA4LTRmNDEtNjM1OC1iMjY2MTBmNTRhODYNCm1haWx0bzpkYXJrZXJkYXlzcmFkaW8mIzY0O2dtYWlsLmNvbQ0KLS0t\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"f59194879e908791948c868794919c9ab59298949c99db969a98\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"http://static.wixstatic.com/media/974095_396b9f09df7d4e6ab0d85f1a0dd549bb~mv2.jpg/v1/fit/w_700,h_2000,al_c,q_85/image.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-20T20:39:43-08:00","id":1020151,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/darker-days-radio-episode-74/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio Episode #74</a><br /> <b>World of Darkness: Berlin</b></span></span></span><br /> <spa