ackelope <b>Cyberpunk: Night City LARP</b> and a review of <b>World of Future Darkness</b>.</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-16T06:57:33-07:00","id":1297235,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/103-cyberpunk-night-city-larp-special-guest-matt-webb/\" target=\"_blank\">#103: Cyberpunk Night City LARP (Special Guest Matt Webb)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">March 8, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike, Chris, and Chigg are joined by Matt Webb of Jackalope Live Action Studios to discuss the upcoming <b>Cyberpunk: Night City LARP</b>! Matt explains the vision for the live action game, the unique venue they've chosen, and the incredible rules and set design that will make Cyberpunk come alive.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Cyberpunk: Night City</b> will take place May 24-25, 2019 in San Antonio, Texas and on 