resentation of East Asian cultures.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-29T18:29:21-07:00","id":1328194,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/114-world-of-darkness-demon-hunter-x-character-creation-and-hot-takes/\" target=\"_blank\">#114: World of Darkness Demon Hunter X Character Creation and Hot Takes</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">July 26, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Chris makes a character for <b>Demon Hunter X</b> - a tough Strike Force Zero operative based off Major Kusanagi from <b>Ghost in the Shell</b>. Mike and Chigg tag along for color commentary, and also discuss a few cool additional rules for Shih and SF0 characters alike.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Check out the <a href=\"https://darkerdaysradio.wordpress.com/?p=3019\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Blog</a> for a copy of this episodes character sheet!</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-03T17:13:54-07:00","id":1329195,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/116-modiphius-entertainment-live-from-gencon-2019/\" target=\"_blank\">#116: Modiphius Entertainment (Live From Gencon 2019)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">August 3, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Chigg infiltrates the Modiphius Entertainment booth to interview Head of RPGs Sam Webb and Founder Chris Birch about the latest products coming out and to get listeners some tid bits about future <b>World of Darkness</b> books.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Time Stamps:<br /> 00:00:33 - Chat with Sam Webb<br /> 00:04:10 - Chat with Chris Birch</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-04T08:19:16-07:00","id":1329278,"title":"","content":"<b>Sorry for the out of order - just realized we didn't post this important Onyx Path related episode. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/115-whats-up-with-onyx-path-live-from-gencon-2019/\" target=\"_blank\">#115: What\u2019s Up With Onyx Path (Live From Gencon 2019)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">August 2, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">RichT, Matt McElroy, and a rogue's gallery of freelancers bring you the latest news from Onyx Path Publishing, including exclusive new announcements for <b>World of Darkness</b>, <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b>, <b>Exalted</b>, <b>Scion</b>, and<b>Trinity</b>.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Onyx Path was gracious enough to let us record and release their panel. Please also consider following their new <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theonyxpath\" target=\"_blank\">Twitch channel</a>!</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Time Stamps:<br /> 00:01:05 - What's Up with Onyx Path?</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-09T14:45:36-07:00","id":1330137,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/117-vampire-5th-edition-warcry-and-gw-ex-staffer-chat-live-from-fanboy-3-gencon-pop-up-2019/\" target=\"_blank\">#117: Vampire 5th Edition, Warcry, and GW Ex-Staffer Chat (Live from Fanboy 3 Gencon Pop-up 2019)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">August 6, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Fueled only by beer and curry, Chris is joined by David Whitworth of the <a href=\"https://darkerdaysradio.wordpress.com/2019/07/02/shadows-and-skirmish/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Blog</a> and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/RisingSunPaintingStudio/about/\" target=\"_blank\">Rising Sun Painting Studio</a>. They discuss their <b>Vampire: the Masquerade 5th Edition</b> demos using the upcoming <b>Ahriman Contract</b> scenario, the brand new Warhammer <b>Warcry</b> skirmish game, <b>Kult</b>, <b>Kingdom Death</b>, and upcoming UK conventions. Then the electronic base beat starts and things get interesting as these two former Games Workshop: Manchester employees start swapping war stories from the good 'ole days...</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Time Stamps:<br /> 00:00:33 - Gencon Pop-Up Discussion<br /> 00:22:40 - GW Ex-Staffers Talk About Old Times</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-10T18:22:03-07:00","id":1330331,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/118-chiggs-gencon-2019-roundup-live-from-his-kitchen-table/\" target=\"_blank\">#118: Chigg\u2019s Gencon 2019 Roundup (Live From His Kitchen Table)</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">August 9, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Surviving his arduous journey back to the Lone Star State, Chigg regales Mike and the listeners with stories of his Gencon experience. He recounts tales of <b>Star Trek</b>technobabble, the dangers of chocolate in <b>Pugmire</b>, gives warnings of collectible card game addiction, and tantalizes with the possibility of running <b>Cyberpunk Red</b>. </span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">This episode is a bit light on the horror roleplaying content, but we'll be back to our regularly scheduled shows in two weeks!</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Time Stamps:<br /> 00:00:33 - Gencon Roundup!</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-02T05:57:05-07:00","id":1333658,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/119-tabletop-freelance-writing-with-crystal-mazur/\" target=\"_blank\">#119: Tabletop Freelance Writing with Crystal Mazur</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">August 30, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crystal Mazur returns to the show to discuss Chicago by Night 5th Edition (now released to kickstarter backers), talk about her other cool writing projects, and also give tons of tips and tricks to budding writers who want to break into the industry!</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Time Stamps:<br /> 00:05:05 - News<br /> 00:10:15 - Never Going Home Discussion<br /> 00:17:00 - Chicago by Night<br /> 00:35:42 - Storytellers Vault<br /> 00:43:00 - Snowhaven Discussion<br /> 00:51:15 - Freelance Writing Tips and Tricks</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T13:05:27-08:00","id":1348714,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://podcast.darker-days.org/e/125-gehenna-gaming-the-world-of-darkness-multi-game-collective/\" target=\"_blank\">#125: Gehenna Gaming, The World of Darkness Multi-Game Collective</a></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">November 15, 2019</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Mike and Chris are joined by Ian of <b>Gehenna Gaming</b>, a rad gaming collective using interlinked tabletop chronicles of <b>Vampire: the Masquerade</b> to tell complex stories and also introduce new players to the game. Ian discusses the group's current New England based chronicles, their plans to explore <b>Kult</b> and <b>Call of Cthulhu</b>, and finally some spicy plans for the future.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Gehenna Gaming and Mike of Darker Days will be running 4 tables of Vampire: the Masquerade 5th Edition games at <b>PAX Unplugged</b> - December 6th-8th in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. Come by and join us!</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","ava